      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 2. Outfit Sheet\n\nOne prompt per outfit style, as a **list**: one queue renders every view of the **same person**.\n\n- `sheet`: Range (6), Everyday (4), Work to evening (4) or Every style.\n- `backdrop`: a grey, white or black studio (every style fits), or keep the character's own scene (styles that place does not allow are skipped).\n- Face, body and hair colour stay; makeup, jewellery and hair styling follow the outfit when needed.\n- A cosplay or full-suit character gives one view: the costume is the outfit."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## 2. Outfit Sheet\n\nOne prompt per outfit style, as a **list**: one queue renders every view of the **same person**.\n\n- `sheet`: Range (6), Everyday (4), Work to evening (4) or Every style.\n- `backdrop`: a grey, white or black studio (every style fits), or keep the character's own scene (styles that place does not allow are skipped).\n- Face, body and hair colour stay; makeup, jewellery and hair styling follow the outfit when needed.\n- A cosplay or full-suit character gives one view: the costume is the outfit."
      },
